    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "The four `determinism / emit` jobs run on every pull request, queue entry and push to `main`, and each builds the CLI and a test target from nothing. `Swatinem/rust-cache`, pinned to a commit SHA, restores the cargo registry and target for each triple, keyed so a cached tree never outlives the toolchain and `Cargo.lock` that built it, and saved from `main` only so pull requests do not churn a repository cache that is already over its limit. The wall clock before and after is measured, as note 06 3.10 requires.\n",
